== Effects ==
* Spawns an [[orbital familiar]] that blocks enemy shots and deals 7 damage per tick on contact.
** {{dlc|nr}} This deals 105 damage per second.
** {{dlc|r}} This deals 52.5 damage per second.
* Increases the speed that all orbital familiars rotate around Isaac at.
* {{transformation contribution|Seraphim|dlc=anr}}
* {{transformation contribution|Conjoined|dlc=r}}

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Sacrificial Altar}}: This familiar will also reward 2 {{e|Black Heart}}s when sacrificed.
* {{i|Spin to Win}}: The two orbital speed boosts stack.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Big Fan}}: Overrides Guardian Angel's speed boost. If Guardian Angel was obtained first, it will retain its own increased speed. If Big Fan was obtained first, Guardian Angel will be slower.

